      "text": "Redraw challenge (do this after each block)\n1. Close this file. On a blank page, draw the HLD (section 1) from memory.\n2. Draw the state machine (section 3) including the illegal transitions.\n3. Explain out loud: what happens when a worker dies mid-job?\n4. Open this file and compare. Fix what you missed.",
