      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "A service that accepts work, hands it to a pool of workers, and makes sure every job\nruns exactly once — even when workers crash, jobs fail, or clients send the same request twice.",
      "originalText": "A service that accepts work, hands it to a pool of workers, and makes sure every job\nruns exactly once — even when workers crash, jobs fail, or clients send the same request twice.",
